### Récupérer un access token Keycloak (password grant)
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/takalo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = password &
client_id = takalo-backend &
username = admin &
password = adminadmin

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

### Créer un budget (cas nominal — fond positif)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Courses",
  "description": "Budget des courses du mois",
  "fond": 500.00
}

> {%
    client.global.set("budget_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Créer un budget — fond négatif (autorisé)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Decouvert",
  "description": "Budget initialisé en négatif",
  "fond": -100.00
}

### Créer un budget — fond zéro (autorisé)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vide",
  "fond": 0.00
}

### Créer un second budget (cible pour les transferts)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Loisirs",
  "description": "Budget loisirs",
  "fond": 200.00
}

> {%
    client.global.set("target_budget_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Créer un budget — nom vide (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "fond": 100.00
}

### Créer un budget — fond manquant (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SansFond"
}

### Créer un budget — nom déjà pris (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Courses",
  "fond": 200.00
}

### Obtenir un budget par id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Obtenir un budget — id inconnu (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les budgets (page par défaut)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les budgets — pagination personnalisée
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Mettre à jour un budget — nom et description
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Courses du mois",
  "description": "Budget mis à jour"
}

### Mettre à jour un budget — nom vide (400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "description": "Invalide"
}

### Mettre à jour un budget — id inconnu (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inexistant",
  "description": "—"
}

### Créditer un budget depuis une source externe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "montant": 150.00,
  "date": "2026-04-29T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Apport personnel"
}

### Créditer un budget — montant non strictement positif (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "montant": 0,
  "date": "2026-04-29T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Invalide"
}

### Créditer un budget — raison manquante (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "montant": 50.00,
  "date": "2026-04-29T10:00:00Z"
}

### Créditer un budget — id inconnu (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "montant": 50.00,
  "date": "2026-04-29T10:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Test"
}

### Transférer entre deux budgets (cas nominal)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceBudgetId": "{{budget_id}}",
  "targetBudgetId": "{{target_budget_id}}",
  "montant": 75.00,
  "date": "2026-04-29T11:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Réallocation mensuelle"
}

### Transférer — même source et cible (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceBudgetId": "{{budget_id}}",
  "targetBudgetId": "{{budget_id}}",
  "montant": 10.00,
  "date": "2026-04-29T11:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Invalide"
}

### Transférer — montant non strictement positif (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceBudgetId": "{{budget_id}}",
  "targetBudgetId": "{{target_budget_id}}",
  "montant": 0,
  "date": "2026-04-29T11:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Invalide"
}

### Transférer — budget source inconnu (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceBudgetId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "targetBudgetId": "{{target_budget_id}}",
  "montant": 10.00,
  "date": "2026-04-29T11:00:00Z",
  "raison": "Test"
}

### Consulter les mouvements d'un budget
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter les mouvements — filtre par type CREDIT_EXTERNAL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/movements?type=CREDIT_EXTERNAL
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter les mouvements — filtre par type TRANSFER_OUT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/movements?type=TRANSFER_OUT
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter les mouvements — id inconnu (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter la timeline d'un budget
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter la timeline — fenêtre [start, end]
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/timeline?start=2026-04-01T00:00:00Z&end=2026-04-30T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consulter la timeline — fenêtre invalide start > end (400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/timeline?start=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z&end=2026-04-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les éditeurs d'un budget
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/editors
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Ajouter un éditeur à un budget
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/editors
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Ajouter un éditeur — userId manquant (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/editors
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Ajouter un éditeur — utilisateur déjà éditeur (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/editors
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Retirer un éditeur d'un budget
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/editors/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Retirer un éditeur — utilisateur non éditeur (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}/editors/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Supprimer un budget
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/{{budget_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Supprimer un budget — id inconnu (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Sans authentification (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/budgets
